Sphagnum fimbriatum {{Person|Wilson}} & {{Person|[[William Jackson Hooker|Hook.]]}}
Sphagnum fuscum ({{Person|[[Wilhelm Philipp Schimper|Schimp.]]}}) {{Person|[[Hugo Erich Meyer von Klinggräff|H.Klinggr.]]}}
Sphagnum girgensohnii {{Person|[[Edmund August Friedrich Russow|Russow]]}}
Sphagnum molle {{Person|[[William Sullivant|Sull.]]}}
Sphagnum quinquefarium ({{Person|[[Sextus Otto Lindberg|Lindb.]]}} ex {{Person|[[Robert Braithwaite|Braithw.]]}}) {{Person|[[Carl Warnstorf|Warnst.]]}}
